      "scene": "旅游求助小贴士",
      "body": "When you travel to a foreign country, it is important to know how to ask for help (1)____. In many places, people may not speak your (2)____. So a polite smile and a few simple words can (3)____ a lot. Instead of saying \"Where is the bank?\", it is (4)____ to say \"Excuse me, could you please tell me where the bank is?\" This kind of question shows (5)____. Most people are happy to (6)____ a polite visitor. If you do not understand the (7)____, you can ask the person to say it again slowly. Remember to (8)____ them afterwards. Being polite does not (9)____ much time, but it can make your trip much more (10)____. Good manners are welcome everywhere in the world.",
